1
00:00:00,929 --> 00:00:03,329
(Bernadette:)Okay. Okay,
how about this?

2
00:00:03,332 --> 00:00:04,432
(Bernadette:)They don't know
you're here with us,

3
00:00:04,433 --> 00:00:06,663
(Bernadette:)so you hide in the closet.
When they show up,

4
00:00:06,668 --> 00:00:08,238
(Bernadette:)we'll hear
whatever their dumb story is

5
00:00:08,236 --> 00:00:10,066
(Bernadette:)about where they were,
we'll pretend to believe them,

6
00:00:10,072 --> 00:00:12,802
(Bernadette:)and just when they think they
got away with it, you jump out.

7
00:00:12,808 --> 00:00:14,708
(Penny:)Yeah, that's pretty good.
I love it!

8
00:00:14,710 --> 00:00:16,940
I'll be all like, "Busted!"

9
00:00:16,945 --> 00:00:18,415
And they'll be like, "What?!"

10
00:00:18,413 --> 00:00:21,453
(Raj:)And then we'll all be like,
"Oh, yeah!"

11
00:00:22,851 --> 00:00:24,181
Yeah, I-I get it.

12
00:00:24,186 --> 00:00:26,386
(Raj:)I wouldn't make out
with me, either.

13
00:00:28,724 --> 00:00:31,694
(Sheldon:)In here is every clock radio
I've ever owned.

14
00:00:31,693 --> 00:00:33,593
(Sheldon:)Calculators, VHS tapes.

15
00:00:33,595 --> 00:00:34,995
(Sheldon:)Yeah. Oh.

16
00:00:34,997 --> 00:00:37,197
(Sheldon:)Sporting equipment.

17
00:00:39,201 --> 00:00:41,431
Y-You have sporting equipment?

18
00:00:41,436 --> 00:00:43,766
(Sheldon:)Well, oh, it's just a...
it's a... a golf ball

19
00:00:43,772 --> 00:00:45,772
(Sheldon:)that my brother
threw at my head.

20
00:00:45,774 --> 00:00:48,544
(Sheldon:)You can still
feel the dent.

21
00:00:48,543 --> 00:00:51,813
(Sheldon:)It's right next to
the hockey puck dent.

22
00:00:54,182 --> 00:00:56,752
(Amy:)Okay, why do you have
a bin of pinecones?

23
00:00:56,752 --> 00:00:59,182
(Sheldon:)I used to collect
them as a child.

